  </p>

  <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 animate-gentle-bounce">
    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-muted-light" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 13.5L12 21m0 0l-7.5-7.5M12 21V3" />
